Writing guidelines:
Develop your own idea about what is the best interpretation of the findings you read about;
Briefly summarize the main points of the controversy (about half a page to a page);
Explain which position you find more convincing and why. Grading
At MIT, grading was based on 60% from the exams, 30% from the two papers, and 10% on discussion section participation. Acknowledgements
